MODULE: CutoverKeepsCommittedSnapshotDropsCopy
TARGET: CutoverKeepsCommittedSnapshot
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: topology cutover publishes a new identity without copying the committed source snapshot
PERTURBS: SourceMove

--- FIND
    /\ source' = [source EXCEPT ![alias'] = source[alias]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ source' = [source EXCEPT ![alias'] = 0]
--- END
